---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import imgBeacon from '../../assets/Introduction/BLE Beacon Top Down.jpg';
import imgViper  from '../../assets/Introduction/Viper Link Top Down.jpg';
import imgWasp   from '../../assets/Introduction/wasp-with-tr-edited.jpg';
---

<section class="intro-section" id="introduction">
  <div class="page-container">

    <!-- Text -->
    <div class="intro-text reveal">
      <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
      <h1 class="section-title">Introduction</h1>
      <p class="body-text">
        Our Bluetooth-based radio telemetry system supports a wide variety of wildlife research goals.
        Most importantly, it allows for long-term, continuous monitoring of individual animals,
        potentially over their entire lifespan. By using multiple receivers, you can track animal
        activity and estimate their positions using radio fingerprinting. The transmitters can also
        be equipped with different sensors, such as temperature sensors.
      </p>
      <p class="body-text" style="margin-top:1rem;">
        The system uses a custom version of the Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) protocol to improve battery
        life and transmission range. The transmitters come in many sizes, from an ultra-lightweight
        60&nbsp;mg tag to larger units weighing a few grams that can operate for over 5 years.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Asymmetric image grid: 2 landscape left | 1 portrait right -->
    <div class="intro-gallery reveal" style="transition-delay:0.15s;">

      <!-- Top-left: BLE Beacon (landscape 16:10) -->
      <div class="img-wrap img-beacon glass-card">
        <Image src={imgBeacon} alt="BLE beacon top-down view" class="gallery-img" />
      </div>

      <!-- Bottom-left: Wasp with transmitter (~3:2 landscape) -->
      <div class="img-wrap img-wasp glass-card">
        <Image src={imgWasp} alt="Wasp with radio transmitter attached" class="gallery-img" />
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Viper Link portrait (13:17) -->
      <div class="img-wrap img-viper glass-card">
        <Image src={imgViper} alt="Viper Link receiver top-down view" class="gallery-img" />
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.intro-section {
  padding-block: 5rem 4rem;
}

.intro-text {
  margin-bottom: 3rem;
}

/* ── Asymmetric grid ───────────────────────────────────────── */
.intro-gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  height: 520px;
}

.img-beacon { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; }
.img-wasp   { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; }
.img-viper  { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 3; }

.img-wrap {
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
  transition: transform 0.5s ease;
}
.img-wrap:hover .gallery-img {
  transform: scale(1.03);
}

/* ── Mobile: stack vertically ─────────────────────────────── */
@media (max-width: 767px) {
  .intro-gallery {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
    height: auto;
  }
  .img-beacon { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1; min-height: 220px; }
  .img-viper  { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; min-height: 280px; }
  .img-wasp   { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 3; min-height: 220px; }
}
</style>
